<title>USA: Digital Biometrics names John Metil CFO.</title>
<headline>Digital Biometrics names John Metil CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Biometrics Inc said John Metil was appointed chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Metil was previously executive vice president of Zebulon Group Inc.</p>
<p>He replaces Donald Berg, who resigned in December to take another CFO job, said the maker of identification systems</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
